<title>USA: Corporate Vision acquires T.L. Phipps &amp; Co.</title>
<headline>Corporate Vision acquires T.L. Phipps &amp; Co.</headline>
<dateline>TULSA, Okla. 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corporate Vision Inc said Wednesday it completed its acquisition of privately-held T.L. Phipps &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed, but CVI said it acquired Phipps with cash and restricted common stock, and said the transaction would be accounted for as a purchase.</p>
<p>CVI is a multimedia company that provides video and interactive services to the corporate market.</p>
